  "description": "500W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi MX600Pro is equipped with a 500W high-speed brushless motor, providing strong performance to effortlessly tackle 30° inclines and cruise smoothly on flat city streets. Its brushless design reduces the friction and wear found in traditional brushed motors, ensuring a quieter and more seamless riding experience.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi MX600Pro comes with a removable 48V 20Ah Samsung battery built with 21700 cells, offering up to 60 km in full electric mode and 150 km with pedal assist—perfect for extended city rides. The battery is housed internally and is both waterproof and dustproof, allowing you to ride confidently even in wet conditions.\n\nFront Fork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi MX600Pro features an adjustable aluminum front fork that cushions shocks and vibrations from rough city roads, providing a smoother and more comfortable ride. Its customizable suspension adapts to different terrains, enhancing overall comfort and control.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
